<div class="page">
  <h1>Refunds</h1>
  <p>If a design doesn't work for you, for example the export fails in your browser or the file won't import into your editor, email <a href="mailto:{{ store.supportEmail }}">{{ store.supportEmail }}</a> within 14 days of buying and we'll refund you.</p>
  <p>Refunding an order disables its licence key, so clean downloads stop working for that purchase. Files you've already downloaded must be deleted.</p>
  <p>You can try every design for free first: the watermarked download is the same file, with the watermark.</p>
